# No Cursor commit trailers

Do **not** add Cursor attribution to commits or pull requests.

Forbidden: `Made-with: Cursor`, `Made with Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: Cursor <…>`, any Cursor `--trailer`.

Write plain commit messages only. Do not pass `--trailer` to `git commit`.
